<title>SWEDEN: Volvo U.S. car sales down 2.4 pct Jan.</title>
<headline>Volvo U.S. car sales down 2.4 pct Jan.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish vehicle maker AB Volvo said on Monday that its U.S. car sales fell 2.4 percent in January to 9,480 vehicles.</p>
</text>
